---
title: Getting started
pageSlug: getting-started
mod: bass-sanctum
section: getting-started
order: 1
---

BassSanctum is a pocket dimension with one job: you walk in, you take the thing off the altar, you leave.

A pack author picks the **portal block** in config. Players right-click that block and land in the sanctum. A structure is already there. The altar in the middle holds whatever item was written in config. A lot of packs put a boss summon on it.

That is the whole player story. There is no quest book and no extra biome to learn. If the portal is a crying obsidian block in the hub, you click the crying obsidian.

The altar model is a placeholder. If you ship a resource pack, replace it. Players will notice a nicer altar more than they will notice another config key.
